              <strong class="text-foreground">{t("guide.app_gaming", lang, "Gaming and esports: Competitive gamers need sub-200ms reactions to outperform opponents in FPS, fighting, and MOBA titles.")}</strong>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{t("guide.app_driving", lang, "Driving safety: Emergency braking reactions depend on rapid visual processing. A 50ms improvement can translate to meters of additional stopping distance at highway speeds.")}</strong>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{t("guide.app_sports", lang, "Sports performance: Athletes in tennis, boxing, and baseball rely on split-second visual-motor responses to return serves, dodge punches, or hit fastballs.")}</strong>
            </li>
            <li>
              <strong class="text-foreground">{t("guide.app_health", lang, "Cognitive health monitoring: Tracking your reaction time over time provides insight into cognitive aging, fatigue levels, and the effectiveness of brain training.")}</strong>
            </li>
          </ul>

          <h3 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-foreground">
            {t("guide.h2_beyond", lang, "Beyond Reaction Time: Explore More Cognitive Assessments")}
          </h3>
          <p>
